msgstr "Alternative Umleitung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:174
msgid "Where to send vistors after new plan has been saved as draft."
msgstr ""
"Wohin Besucher nach dem Speichern einen Plans weitergeleitet werden sollen."

