msgstr "Sendeprotokoll geleert."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1077
msgid "Cloning of Mixmymeals_API is forbidden."
msgstr "Das Klonen der MixMyMeals_API ist verboten."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1095
msgid "Unserializing instances of Mixmymeals_API is forbidden."
msgstr "Das Deserialisieren der MixMyMeals_API-Instanzen ist verboten."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals.php:318
msgid "The planner will be cleared and replaced with this meal plan. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Der Planer wird geleert und durch diesen Essensplan ersetzt. Fortfahren?"

